<title>USA: Collective Bancorp completes acquisition.</title>
<headline>Collective Bancorp completes acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>EGG HARBOR, N.J. 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Collective Bancorp Inc said on Tuesday that it has completed its previously announced acquisition of Continental Bancorp.</p>
